|               |             HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1)], projection=[id@0, subject@1, answer_embedding@2, _score@3, answer@4, question@6, reference_answer@7, source@8]      |
